          ],
          "conf": 0.514,
          "text": "$$(1+x)^n = {}^n\\text{C}_0(1)^n + {}^n\\text{C}_1(1)^{n-1}x + {}^n\\text{C}_2(1)^{n-2}x^2 + ... + {}^n\\text{C}_n x^n$$\n$$= {}^n\\text{C}_0 + {}^n\\text{C}_1 x + {}^n\\text{C}_2 x^2 + {}^n\\text{C}_3 x^3 + ... + {}^n\\text{C}_n x^n$$\n$$(1+x)^n = {}^n\\text{C}_0 + {}^n\\text{C}_1 x + {}^n\\text{C}_2 x^2 + {}^n\\text{C}_3 x^3 + ... + {}^n\\text{C}_n x^n$$"
